    // Autosave and the explicit "Save changes" button both ultimately call
    // WikiService.SavePageAsync against the same long-lived per-circuit DbContext. Without this,
    // a click landing while an autosave write is already mid-flight lets the two calls race on
    // the same tracked entity - whichever's (possibly stale) snapshot commits last silently wins,
    // which is what wiped page content out from under an explicit save. This serializes the two
